# All settings are stored in mynews.db (SQLite).
# Use the Settings UI in the app to configure credentials.
#
# Keys stored in the `settings` table:
#   FACEBOOK_APP_ID         — from your app → Settings → Basic
#   FACEBOOK_APP_SECRET     — same place
#   FACEBOOK_ACCESS_TOKEN   — short-lived user token (used by npm run facebook-token)
#   WEIBO_APP_KEY           — Weibo developer app key
#   WEIBO_APP_SECRET        — Weibo developer app secret
#   WEIBO_ACCESS_TOKEN      — set automatically via OAuth callback
#   WEIBO_UID               — set automatically via OAuth callback
#   ZHIHU_COOKIE            — z_c0 cookie from browser DevTools when logged in to zhihu.com
#   STACKEXCHANGE_KEY       — optional Stack Exchange API key (increases rate limits)
#
# Facebook page targets are stored in the `facebook_targets` table.
# Run `npm run facebook-token` to exchange a user token for page tokens.
